{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTEraseMax","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mathlib.SYTEraseMax","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Mathlib.SYTMaxCorner"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.eraseMax","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.eraseMax","kind":"def","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEraseMax.lean#L48-L109","doc":"**The forward branching map.** Delete the max-value corner `c` of `T` to get a standard tableau of\n`μ ∖ c`: its entry map is `T`'s on the surviving cells, and the entry bijection lands on\n`{1, …, |μ ∖ c|}` because the only cell that held `|μ|` was the deleted corner. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mathlib.eraseMaxSsyt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mathlib.eraseMaxSsyt","kind":"def","line":26,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mathlib/SYTEraseMax.lean#L26-L46","doc":"**Semistandard tableau of `μ ∖ c`** obtained by blanking the corner cell `c` of `T`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}